Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: holding play closes the mini player

The mini player stays as long as anything is loaded, and nothing but closing
the app unloaded it. Holding its play or pause button now stops playback
and empties the queue, so the media item is gone and the bar slides away.

Change-Id: Ie25ebdfb70c86657556f7b83b1b9e46b11863fb0
